# Naming Conventions

## Files

- **Components**: PascalCase (`MyComponent.tsx`, `UserService.ts`)
- **Tests**: Co-located with `.test.ts` extension (`MyComponent.test.ts`)
- **Fixtures**: Co-located with `.fixture.tsx` extension

## Code

- **Components**: PascalCase (`MyComponent`)
- **Functions/variables**: camelCase (`getUserById`, `isActive`)
- **Constants**: UPPER_SNAKE_CASE for true constants (`MAX_RETRIES`)

## Schemas & Types

- **Zod schemas**: `{resourceName}FormSchema`, `{resourceName}FiltersSchema`, `{resourceName}SortingSchema`
- **Types**: PascalCase with descriptive suffix (`UserFormValues`, `InvoiceData`, `ContactListProps`)